  "description": "Summer 2026/2027 Operating Area: Corsica, French Riviera & Monaco, Provence Coast & Marseille Baltic Sea, Denmark, Norway, Sweden\nWinter Operating Area: Bermuda, Dominican Republic, Leeward Islands, Trinidad & Tobago, Turks and Caicos, Windward Islands\n\n\nHu-Lysse is a brand-new Sunreef 80 Eco created for exceptional charter experiences in some of the world’s most desirable cruising destinations. With four beautifully appointed cabins, expansive living areas and a refined contemporary interior, she offers an exceptional setting for families and friends to enjoy complete comfort and privacy at sea.\n\nFrom summer escapes across the Mediterranean to winter cruising in the Caribbean, Hu-Lysse brings together generous outdoor spaces, sophisticated design and the unmistakable luxury of the Sunreef 80 Eco. Whether relaxing on deck, dining alfresco or retreating to the privacy of her elegant interiors, every element of life on board is designed around effortless enjoyment.",
